<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 19 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 19 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 19</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............803,400 up.....6,200</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......700,800 down...4,600</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......536,300 up.....3,400</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....812,630 up........24</p>
<p> Financial companies.......626,673 down...1,006</p>
<p> New York business loans....44,804 up.......962</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......44,560 up.......954</p>
</text>
